  "caveats": [
   "The printed Contents does not list Salemann's foreword (V-VI, 1-015-1-016); it is not added here, being no entry of the book's.",
   "A row the book prints over several numbers is one entry per number, each taking its folio from that row in printed order. \"50—61\" prints ten folios for twelve numbers: the running heads and the item headings in the body show it omits 165 (no. 54) and 171 (no. 59), and those two carry page_from saying so. row_folios keeps the row as printed.",
   "notes is the folio in parentheses after a Section I entry: where that text's «Примѣчанія» begin. Sections II and III print none; their notes are footnotes.",
   "title is keyed as printed, pre-reform orthography and the book's misprints included (sic marks them). title_en is a translation at #llm.",
   "tier1 lists the Chukchi forms inside a title. They are model readings awaiting a human's ratification glyph by glyph, as the firewall requires; the Russian around them is outside it. Notation glyphs not yet in the inventory are keyed with the codepoint the text layer uses for them and flagged in glyph_unsettled."
  ],
  "resp": {
   "title": "#llm",
   "title_en": "#llm",
   "tier1": "#llm"
  },
  "glyph_unsettled": [
   "ђ: a hooked g-like sort (Нарђынен'а, Аттыђыткыновы, Кэlі́lђу); the text layer's codepoint, not a reading of the inventory",
   "ӄ: k with a hook below (Куӄа́lђон); likewise",
   "ę: e with a hook below (Кэlę); likewise",
   "ṫ: t with a dot above (Муṫу́wђі); likewise"
  ]
 },
